This directory is a vendored variant of the spectrum viewer from W1700K-SDR
(https://github.com/h0m3us3r/w1700k-sdr), copied at commit 0b0413e and
redistributed under its original MIT license above, with full credit to
h0m3us3r. Adaptations made for openwrt-one-sdr are minimal and marked in-file
(for example the page title in web/index.html); see README.md. Every source
file keeps its upstream SPDX-License-Identifier header.
